{"name":"The Designate Sign","slug":"glyph-designate-sign","blurb":"On the designate street, Dell carries the sign toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Designate. Click the sign and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Designate Sign.","seal":"e345a5681d8d4181c03150b400b35b7d654e64c29509debe2d6505700ec8236e"}
